1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,970
(Bernadette:)and one day you wake up
and you're pregnant.

2
00:00:01,969 --> 00:00:03,769
(Bernadette:)And it doesn't matter that your
career's going great right now

3
00:00:03,771 --> 00:00:05,871
(Bernadette:)and that you and your husband
never even got to go anywhere

4
00:00:05,873 --> 00:00:08,973
taped to a dog!

5
00:00:08,976 --> 00:00:11,846
(Raj:)I skipped spin class for this.

6
00:00:14,849 --> 00:00:17,919
(Howard:)Why is it taking him so long

7
00:00:17,918 --> 00:00:19,948
(Howard:)to get a drink out
of a vending machine?

8
00:00:19,954 --> 00:00:21,684
(Leonard:)Oh, it's complicated.

9
00:00:21,689 --> 00:00:23,089
(Leonard:)He finds pushing
that little door

10
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:26,290
(Leonard:)and reaching up into the machine
uncomfortably intimate.

11
00:00:28,295 --> 00:00:30,365
(Sheldon:)Gentlemen, I am ready to work.

12
00:00:30,364 --> 00:00:33,134
To quote The Martian, "Let's
science the feces out of this!"

13
00:00:33,134 --> 00:00:34,904
That's The Martian the book

14
00:00:34,902 --> 00:00:36,602
and The Martian the movie,
not Marvin the Martian.

15
00:00:36,604 --> 00:00:37,904
(Sheldon:)Although to quote
Marvin the Martian,

16
00:00:37,905 --> 00:00:39,175
"I claim this planet

17
00:00:39,173 --> 00:00:40,573
in the name of Mars."

18
00:00:40,574 --> 00:00:43,514
(Leonard:)Are you okay?

19
00:00:43,511 --> 00:00:45,181
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'm fantastic,
never been better.

20
00:00:45,179 --> 00:00:46,549
(Sheldon:)I had my first energy drink

21
00:00:46,547 --> 00:00:47,977
(Sheldon:)and I feel great.

22
00:00:47,982 --> 00:00:48,912
(Sheldon:)Hey, you guys want to wrestle?

23
00:00:48,916 --> 00:00:50,646
(Sheldon:)We can do arm,
thumb, mud, sumo.

24
00:00:50,651 --> 00:00:53,221
(Sheldon:)Nah, we're not fat enough,
or wearing diapers.

25
00:00:56,223 --> 00:01:09,033
(Howard:)You wanted him awake.

